---
---This native configures the location, size, rotation, normal height, and the difference ratio between min, normal and max.
---
---All those natives combined they will output something like this:
---![](https://i.imgur.com/slYthff.png)
function TerraingridSetParams(x: number, y: number, z: number, p3: number, rotation: number, p5: number, width: number, height: number, p8: number, scale: number, glowIntensity: number, normalHeight: number, heightDiff: number): () end

