---This function hides various HUD (Heads-up Display) components.
---
---Listed below are the integers and the corresponding HUD component.
---
---*   1 : WANTED_STARS
---*   2 : WEAPON_ICON
---*   3 : CASH
---*   4 : MP_CASH
---*   5 : MP_MESSAGE
---*   6 : VEHICLE_NAME
---*   7 : AREA_NAME
---*   8 : VEHICLE_CLASS
---*   9 : STREET_NAME
---*   10 : HELP_TEXT
---*   11 : FLOATING_HELP_TEXT\_1
---*   12 : FLOATING_HELP_TEXT\_2
---*   13 : CASH_CHANGE
---*   14 : RETICLE
---*   15 : SUBTITLE_TEXT
---*   16 : RADIO_STATIONS
---*   17 : SAVING_GAME
---*   18 : GAME_STREAM
---*   19 : WEAPON_WHEEL
---*   20 : WEAPON_WHEEL_STATS
---*   21 : HUD_COMPONENTS
---*   22 : HUD_WEAPONS
---
---These integers also work for the [`SHOW_HUD_COMPONENT_THIS_FRAME`](#\_0x0B4DF1FA60C0E664) native, but instead shows the HUD Component.
function HideHudComponentThisFrame(id: integer): () end

