---```
---0=unknown (or incorrect weaponHash)  
---1= no damage (flare,snowball, petrolcan)  
---2=melee  
---3=bullet  
---4=force ragdoll fall  
---5=explosive (RPG, Railgun, grenade)  
---6=fire(molotov)  
---8=fall(WEAPON_HELI_CRASH)  
---10=electric  
---11=barbed wire  
---12=extinguisher  
---13=gas  
---14=water cannon(WEAPON_HIT_BY_WATER_CANNON)  
---```
